deviceinfo_comment="Bootloader must be unlocked via MiUnlockTool before flashing.

Mandatory pre-flash step (disable AVB to boot custom images):
  fastboot flash vbmeta --disable-verity --disable-verification vbmeta.img

Standard flash procedure:
  fastboot flash boot boot.img
  fastboot flash dtbo dtbo.img
  fastboot flash userdata rootfs.img
  fastboot set_active a
  fastboot reboot

Hardware details (verified from dmesg):
- SoC: Snapdragon 8 Elite (SM8750-AB)
- Display: 11.2\" 3200x2136 DSI LCD (panel: xiaomi p81 35 02 0b vid mode dualdsi dsc)
- GPU: Adreno 830 (freedreno / a680)
- WiFi: WCN7850 (ath12k, PCIe)
- Bluetooth: WCN7850 (btqca, GENI UART)
- Touch: Novatek nt36532 (SPI, IRQ 674) - Note: device tree must use novatek compatible
- Storage: UFS (KIOXIA)
- PMIC: PM8750 with battery charging
- Backlight: ktz8866 (I2C) - device tree must include backlight node
- Audio: fs19xx smartpa (I2C 0x34-0x37)

Important: The device tree must be significantly enhanced compared to the current skeleton.
Missing nodes: DSI panel, backlight, correct touch compatible, and possibly others.
Refer to the original Android kernel dts for proper configuration.
"